From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jens Willmer <info@jwillmer.de>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 15:57:23 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 098/110] A drag over a scrolled code block or table picks the
 right line

The text runs near the pointer compared where it is by their own
positions, which inside a code block or table scrolled sideways are
shifted by that scroll, so the wrong run could count as nearest. They
now compare the pointer's position in the window, the same for all.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

